{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15107140","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15107140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510713001:":{"text":"초소까지만 가면 되는 거지?","source_cn":"送到哨卡就行了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x462E5AC70F7B4588","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510713002:":{"text":"응. 그 다음은 최전방이야.","source_cn":"对，下一趟再送去前线","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47C440A5596A72F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510713003:":{"text":"길이 막혔어요.","source_cn":"路被拦住了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1192C2EF5327B57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510713004:":{"text":"저 병사를 쫓아갈 방법을 찾아야 해. 절대 놓쳐선 안돼!","source_cn":"想办法追上那个士兵，不能跟丢！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8E0F755947A8FC35","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"저 병사를 쫓아갈 방법을 찾아야 해. 절대 놓쳐선 안돼!","female":"저 병사를 쫓아갈 방법을 찾아야 해. 절대 놓쳐선 안돼!","variant_male_record_index":"179975","variant_female_record_index":"179976","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1510713005:":{"text":"제게 맡겨주십시오.","source_cn":"交给我","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF45C83566185120B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510714001:0":{"text":"...길이, 마차에 막혀버렸어요.","source_cn":"……路，被马车堵住了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF17908BAF1F0B29A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510714002:0":{"text":"제가 그 병사를 향해 추적의 창을 던져두었습니다.","source_cn":"我已向他掷出追踪矛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD22E7A3EE573BCD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510714003:0":{"text":"마차만 지나가면, 바로 쫓아갈 수 있을 겁니다.","source_cn":"马车让开后，立刻就能跟上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD67211E4282E1666","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510714004:0":{"text":"마차에 무기가 가득 실려 있어요. 보칼리스인이 정말 전쟁을 일으키려나 봐요...","source_cn":"车上装满了武器。呼临人真的要发动大战……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BC402343DBF61E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:10:1510714005:0":{"text":"초조한 마음으로 한참을 기다린 뒤에야, 길을 막고 있던 마차가 지나갔다","source_cn":"焦急地等待了好一阵后，拥堵的马车终于离去","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B903B891500E93D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510